research/advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23-owner-resolution/adhm-gaga-analytic-scaffold.md-15-Statement: Assume AC. On every finite-dimensional complex manifold M the holomorphic structure sheaf O_M is coherent: the relation sheaf of any finite tuple of local holomorphic sections is locally finitely generated. Coherent O_M-modules are closed under kernels, cokernels and finite extensions. For every coherent F, point x and finite integer l≥0, there is a chart neighborhood W of x on which F has an exact partial free resolution O_W^{p_l}→…→O_W^{p_0}→F|_W→0 by finite ranks. Exactness at the leftmost term is not asserted. No global analytic free resolution is claimed.
