research/advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23-owner-resolution/adhm-gaga-analytic-plan-fragment.json-17-  "preserve_current_gaga_statement": "For $n=2$ or $3$, let $X=\\mathbb P^n_{\\mathbb C}$ and let $X^{an}$ be its complex analytic space. Define analytification by $\\mathcal F^{an}=\\mathcal F\\otimes_{\\mathcal O_X}\\mathcal O_{X^{an}}$. It is an exact tensor-compatible equivalence from algebraic coherent sheaves (locally finitely presented $\\mathcal O_X$-modules) to holomorphic coherent sheaves. It identifies algebraic and holomorphic morphisms, preserves cohomology and the derived morphism groups $\\operatorname{Ext}^q$, and commutes with restriction to the fixed hyperplane $L_\\infty=\\{z_0=0\\}$. For an algebraic coherent sheaf $\\mathcal E$ flat over a finite-type complex parameter scheme $S$, let $p:X\\times S\\to S$ be projection. Analytification commutes with the algebraic family structure and fiber restrictions. Whenever the algebraic and analytic higher direct images $R^qp_*\\mathcal E$ are locally free and the natural maps from their residue-field fibers to $H^q(X_s,\\mathcal E_s)$ are isomorphisms, the comparison identifies those direct images and base-change maps. No assertion is made that an arbitrary holomorphic family over a nonproper algebraic base algebraizes.",
research/advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23-owner-resolution/adhm-gaga-analytic-plan-fragment.json-18-  "gaga_integration_obligation": "Preserve the full current batch59 Statement. Prove full Serre \u00a716 positive-twist uniform generation inside old59 by simultaneous dimension induction: lower-dimensional GAGA plus algebraic Serre gives hyperplane vanishing/generation; coherent kernel/Tor and cokernel are retained; compact coherent H^1 finiteness enables stabilization; Nakayama and compactness yield uniform finite generation. No new same-dimension theorem depends on old59. The owner has now authored the restricted relative comparison in current GAGA steps6.1\u20139.1; it still depends on absolute comparison, and no unrestricted relative GAGA is claimed.",
