+---
+id: lem-qftx-gaga-analytic-bounded-degree-relations
+kind: lemma
+title: "Local relations among Weierstrass polynomials reduce to bounded degree"
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+domain: mathematics
+library: mathematics
+dependency_level: 1
+deps:
+  - def-qftx-analytic-coherent-module
